          IsLeave: 0
      - Text: Walk on
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: '"Come back when you''re richer!" he calls after you. "Or less
            observant. I''m not fussy."'
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/rat_caravan/road.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: merchant
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: A wagon squats across the road, painted in six colours of peeling.
          Its wheels come from three different carts. None of them match, and all
          of them squeak.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Customers! Don't be shy. Everything on the wagon is for sale, and a
          surprising amount of it was for sale before I found it.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: grinning
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Blades, boots, tonics. Seventy on the shop's hundred, because I never
          paid the shop's hundred either. Or anything.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: grinning
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Now, some of it's real and some of it isn't. I know which is which.
          That, friends, is the one thing on this wagon that's not for sale.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: neutral
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Behind the wagon, something with a great many teeth shifts its weight
          and goes on pretending to be asleep.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
    - Id: after_browse
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/rat_caravan/caravan.png
      Title: The Rat Caravan
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Walk on
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: '"Tell your friends!" he calls after you. "Tell them I was somewhere
            else."'
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      - Text: Look again
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects:
          - Kind: 11
            Amount: 0
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
