            FightId: 
            ShelfId: caravan
            Reveal: 0
          Result: 
          GoTo: after_browse
          IsLeave: 0
      - Text: Rob him
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects:
          - Kind: 9
            Amount: 0
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
            CharacterDisplayName: 
            RelicId: 
            RelicDisplayName: 
            FightId: rat_pack
            ShelfId: 
            Reveal: 0
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/rat_caravan/road.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: merchant
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Pleasure doing business. Mostly mine, but I like to think a little
          of it rubbed off on you.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: neutral
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: No refunds, mind. Not a policy. I just won't be here.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: neutral
    - Id: after_odette
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/rat_caravan/caravan.png
      Title: The Rat Caravan
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Walk on
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: '"Bring the owl back sometime!" he calls after you. "Actually,
            don''t."'
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      - Text: Look again
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects:
          - Kind: 11
            Amount: 0
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
            CharacterDisplayName: 
            RelicId: 
            RelicDisplayName: 
            FightId: 
            ShelfId: caravan
            Reveal: 0
          Result: 
          GoTo: after_browse
          IsLeave: 0
      - Text: Rob him
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects:
          - Kind: 9
            Amount: 0
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
            CharacterDisplayName: 
            RelicId: 
            RelicDisplayName: 
            FightId: rat_pack
            ShelfId: 
            Reveal: 0
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/rat_caravan/road.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: owl
        Side: 0
      - CharacterId: merchant
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: owl
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 2
        Side: 0
        Text: 'That one is a fake. The rivets are painted on. So is that one: the
          leather is bread crust, varnished.'
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: annoyed
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Sharp eyes! You'd do well in the trade. Well, not in my end of it.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: grinning
      - SpeakerId: owl
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: I have marked every fake for you. Buy the rest if you must, and count
          your fingers after.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: neutral
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: So the unmarked ones are real, then. Probably. I'd stake your life
          on it.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: neutral
    - Id: robbed
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/rat_caravan/robbed.png
      Title: A Lighter Wagon
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Leave
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/rat_caravan/road.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: merchant
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Fine. Take it. Take the lot. I'll only steal it back off someone worse
          than you, and they'll have worse taste.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: hostile
      - SpeakerId: merchant
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: And the piece that went under the wheel in all that? That was the good
          one. The real one. Probably.
        IsEventSpeaker: 1
        ExpressionName: hostile
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: He hitches the empty wagon and rattles off into the trees, swearing
          in a language made mostly of squeaks. The road is quieter without him.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
